Package: finalproject
Title: Public Health Data Analysis
Version: 0.0.3
Authors@R:
    person(given = "Jia",
           family = "Xi",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "jiaxi@hsph.harvard.edu")
Description: This package presents analyses of public health datasets
    using statistical methods and visualization techniques introduced
    in BST260. It investigates relationships between health outcomes
    and demographic or geographic characteristics. The project
    documents data sources, analytical findings, uncertainties,
    and limitations through reproducible reports.
Depends: R (>= 4.5.0)
